<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysian Resources stock suspended.</title>
<headline>Malaysian Resources stock suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock of Malaysian Resources Corp Bhd (MRCB) was suspended on Thursday at the company's request, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Shares of the diversified firm last traded at 7.85, up 25 cents before the suspension. The shares hit a new high of 7.90 ringgit earlier in the session.</p>
<p>Officials of the company could not be reached for comment.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
